OL,3,GNEWSAIs bonfire night on the brink of
OL,4,Aburning itself out?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a British tradition dating back
OL,7,Fcenturies but is bonfire night on the
OL,8,Fbrink of burning itself out?
OL,10,FRed tape, increasing costs and
OL,11,Flegislation to prevent terrorist
OL,12,Fattacks are taking a toll on the
OL,13,Forganisers of public events.
OL,15,FOrganisers of big displays have said it
OL,16,Fis becoming increasingly difficult to
OL,17,Fbreak even, despite the events being
OL,18,Fmore popular than ever.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
