OL,3,GNEWSAIs bonfire night on the brink of
OL,4,Aburning itself out?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Terrorism (Protection of Premises)
OL,7,FAct 2025, also known as Martyn's Law,
OL,8,Fis among the elements they have to
OL,9,Fconsider. While they acknowledge the
OL,10,Fnew law is important, it is an extra
OL,11,Flayer of concern.
